  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">안녕하세요 <br>재과만 초등회원님들께<br>좋은 행사가 있어 소개합니다.<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7aa9e08b927d0ddde2df35f10f682a18180c445d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7aa9e08b927d0ddde2df35f10f682a18180c445d\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>이번주 토요일 <br>청주교대입니다.<br><br>같은 초등학교 및<br>주변 학교 <br>신규초등선생님께<br>홍보부탁드립니다♡<br><br>예비교사성장워크숍 참가신청은<br> <a href=\" https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc5cSV8ot3jf-VeKSTQFu0aLmgv8AegF5IeR3mSBEOvLsdxDw/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"> </a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc5cSV8ot3jf-VeKSTQFu0aLmgv8AegF5IeR3mSBEOvLsdxDw/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc5cSV8ot3jf-VeKSTQFu0aLmgv8AegF5IeR3mSBEOvLsdxDw/viewform</a><br><br>점심 및 기념품도<br>드립니다~<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
